WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
A poster. Eight colours.
Could similar colours share a printing ink?

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Meet OVERPRINT.
A colour helper for printing posters.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Bring similar colours together.
In this example: 8 artwork colours → 4 suggested inks.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
See before. See after.
Same poster. Different colour choices.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
You choose how much changes.
Keep colours close, or allow a bigger change.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Check the colours that changed most.
If you do not like them, adjust and try again.

00:36.000 --> 00:42.000
Fewer inks. Still your design.
Choose your colours. Compare the result. Save it.
